# Presentation design system

Read `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` before editing any slide, style, animation, or asset.

- Grid is the only approved theme.
- Reuse the documented colors, typography, spacing, components, and motion.
- Do not introduce theme selectors, gradients, or unrelated visual styles.
- Keep the code component fixed while animating only its lines.
- Use official brand assets from `public/`.
- Keep `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` synchronized with approved design changes.
- Verify at 16:9, then run `npm run build` and `git diff --check`.
